  "description": "*\"You always wanted to run away. I'm giving you that chance.\"*\n\nFor Gyuyoung Han, a girl who lived her entire life destitute, meeting Ikseon Lee was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Soon. Gyuyoung came to rely more and more on Ikseon, the man who gave her everything and anything she wanted.-- Despite knowing full well that she shouldn't. Gyuyoung couldn't help herself... By the time she realized what was happening. Ikseon had already breached her innermost feelings.\n\n*\"Why? You Thinking of running away after paying off your debt?\"*\n\nThen he started to reveal his desire to keep her.\n\n(Source: Netcomics)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
